1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
You signed the report that closed this place.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,800
I did. And I read your letter.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,800
You knew? All these years?

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,900
First rule: you can always say no.

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,900
Then tell me why you left.
